# Errata: v3 evidence copies at `b5367bc` (V4-18)

The seven files in `v3-evidence-b5367bc/` are **read-only copies** (their `MANIFEST.sha256` pins them), and the v3 originals are outside the v4 fence. This file is the one home for every correction to them. Read a cited line in a copy together with this table.

Sources: verification V3 (`~/hee4-evidence/verification/V3-evidence.md`, 2026-10-01, same-lineage, method `git show b5367bc:<path>`), V2 (`…/V2-design.md`), and the corrections the ULTRAMAP found while mapping (C1-C3). Locators re-read by louranicas-2c on 2026-10-01 with `git -C /run/host/var/home/herdr-engineering-engine-v3 show b5367bc:<path>`.

